# slug: ch74-propagate
# source: chapters/ch74.tex:83
# label: alg:ch74-propagate
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch74.tex:86
# caption: Return through native frames before propagating a managed callback error.

REQUIRE rooted callable, protected runtime entry, native status convention
ENSURE original managed failure is available to the outer wrapper
invoke the callable within the runtime's protected error boundary
IF invocation or result conversion fails THEN
  retain the runtime's original error according to its ownership rules
  return native callback-failure status
END IF
copy the converted callback value to its output; return success
At the outer wrapper after native return:
perform nonthrowing cleanup; propagate a retained failure if present

